WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.582
Count and control interruptions.

00:00:02.582 --> 00:00:08.310
Count aloud in cycles of five up to 100 to support rhythm and tracking.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:10.649
Keep compressions continuous.

00:00:10.649 --> 00:00:23.638
If a lone rescuer becomes tired, any rest should be no longer than 10 seconds and preferably only after about 100 compressions, followed by an immediate restart.
